Subject: [qnx-porter 0001] qnx-source
Source: deterministic rule
Reason: `PATH_MAX` is in <limits.h>, which src/cmocka.c already includes, so a strict feature-test macro hid it. -D_QNX_SOURCE exposes POSIX and QNX extensions in QNX's headers, as _GNU_SOURCE does on glibc.
Error: /home/chirag/qnx-porter/ports-aarch64le/cmocka/work/src/src/cmocka.c:4346:30: error: 'PATH_MAX' undeclared (first use in this function)
